       TransportPodLaunchState.GetFuelCostAnnouncementForTile. {0} = fuel cost,
       {1} = fuel available. "NoLauncher" and "Unavailable" are defensive
       fallbacks when the launchable or its props are missing. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.NoLauncher>aucun lanceur</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.NoLauncher>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.CostUnavailable>coût en carburant indisponible</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.CostUnavailable>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.NotEnough>CARBURANT INSUFFISANT, besoin de {0}, disponible {1}</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.NotEnough>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.CostChemfuel>{0} chemfuel</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.CostChemfuel>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.OutOfRange>HORS DE PORTÉE</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Fuel.OutOfRange>

