       agreement; the pod-noun key is inlined into the sentence so word order
       stays natural across languages.
       {0} = pod count, {1} = total mass capacity. -->
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Loading.OpenAnnouncementOne>Charger la capsule de transport. {0} capsule, {1} kg de capacité. Gauche/Droite pour les onglets, Entrée pour ajuster.</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Loading.OpenAnnouncementOne>
  <RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Loading.OpenAnnouncementMany>Charger les capsules de transport. {0} capsules, {1} kg de capacité. Gauche/Droite pour les onglets, Entrée pour ajuster.</RimWorldAccess.TransportPods.Loading.OpenAnnouncementMany>

